s-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"dGeXdSMah56gEHwZNaRQKA","review_id":"ceiDCygkwOaoaDgaW4tCYQ","date":"2016-05-20T02:29:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9481382369995117,"text_excerpt":"I love Mexican food. One of my favorite places to eat Mexican food is Juan's Flying Burrito. I've never seen any of their locations empty. At this particular location the only gripe I'd have is parking but that's something that can be easily dealt with. What I like about Juan's is the great service I have received time and time agian. Now I don't have super high service standards but when I'm treated to a warm meal, tasty cocktail, and outstanding service it always makes a dining experience memorable. Everyone there from the bartenders to wait staff are top notch. I also like how playful the menu is. They always have a unique special so always ask about that before you dive into the menu...."},{"business_id":"dGeXdSMah56gEHwZNaRQKA","review_id":"tf2LIvC8JmaptPCqrn5CjA","date":"2014-04-06T22:09:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9425055980682373,"text_excerpt":"I remember Juan's being one of the first \"local\" places I ate in NO. Being from the bayou with not many chains, there are only hole-in-the-wall places with everything fried. So when I ventured into the big city, I headed straight to the big chains. Alas, there was Juan's. In my opinion, they have the best guacamole. The atmosphere is noisy and crowded. But service is quick. Great for a group, not great for a first date. I could barely be heard across the table. Overall, I love coming here when I can. Very casual with a delicious menu."},{"business_id":"dGeXdSMah56gEHwZNaRQKA","review_id":"FzAIiRCB41oa1eWGT9wuoQ","date":"2013-11-18T20:22:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9407989978790283,"text_excerpt":"I have been to Juan's on Magazine many times. Recently a group of friends and I decided to head to this location for a late dinner. If you're accustomed to the magazine location you'll immediately find a big difference here. There is a parking lot on side of the restaurant. That alone may make this my go to location of choice as parking uptown is rarely fun. Inside the space seems larger than the other location. I'm not sure if it really is, but the dining area is much more spread out which makes dining comfortable. On the night we went the restaurant was packed. Due to the crowd service suffered and was very slow. Since we were enjoying out conversation we didn't really notice, but if we..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"dGeXdSMah56gEHwZNaRQKA","photo_id":"_XaWiPTtUMiv1kjzrijITA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_XaWiPTtUMiv1kjzrijITA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.825943112373352},{"business_id":"dGeXdSMah56gEHwZNaRQKA","photo_id":"ag0pbtoy_sfRQh-DkiodSw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ag0pbtoy_sfRQh-DkiodSw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.821516215801239},{"business_id":"dGeXdSMah56gEHwZNaRQKA","photo_id":"eJc9jD-4bSqk9w0JR8bFZw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/eJc9jD-4bSqk9w0JR8bFZw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8189190626144409},{"business_id":"dGeXdSMah56gEHwZNaRQKA","photo_id":"kQ7dPGiXmP0ofnPUZdNwYQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/phot